# TOOLS

Tools are executable snippets for this vault.
Define each tool as a level-3 heading and one or more fenced code blocks.
Use a `sh` block for Unix/macOS and a `ps1` block for Windows — both are optional but at least one is required.

### vault-status
Show current vault status.
```sh
bashcorrect vault status
```
```ps1
bashcorrect vault status
```

### list-entities
List entity pages in this vault.
```sh
ls -1 entities/*.md 2>/dev/null || true
```
```ps1
Get-ChildItem -Path entities -Filter '*.md' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -ExpandProperty Name
```

### find-copilot-notes
Search notes that mention copilot.
```sh
grep -Rin "copilot" .
```
```ps1
Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File | Select-String -Pattern 'copilot' -CaseSensitive:$false | Select-Object Path, LineNumber, Line
```
